 "remarks": "Welcome to The Chesterfield, one of Stamford's most iconic & sought-after condo communities. Offering a lifestyle unlike any other, this gated, pet-friendly community features security, two swimming pools, a clubhouse, & beautifully maintained grounds. Freshly painted & new carpeting in loft, LL & Stairs, this updated, move in ready, four-level townhome combines style, space, & convenience. The renovated kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, & abundant natural light. Updated baths & bamboo flooring throughout the main living areas add a modern touch. The spacious living room w/fireplace opens to a private deck, perfect for morning coffee or relaxing at the end of the day. Upstairs, the primary bedroom includes a full bath, while the second bedroom offers flexibility for guests or a home office & another full bath. The loft level is ideal as a den, office, or bonus living space. The finished lower level provides endless possibilities for a recreation room, gym, media room, or workspace. An attached one-car garage completes the home. Ideally located across from shopping, dining, & everyday conveniences. Just minutes from downtown Stamford's restaurants, theaters, nightlife, & shopping. Convenient to Metro-North, I-95, the Merritt Parkway, & Stamford's beautiful beaches. A rare opportunity to enjoy resort-style living in one of Stamford's premier communities. Windows \"As is\". click on movie icon for virtual tour.",
